              "|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| US / China | Free Trade (F) | Tariff (T) |\n| Free Trade (F) | 100, 100 | 70, 120 |\n| Tariff (T) | 120, 80 | 75, 60 |\n\nReference:\n\nKrishnadev Calamur,  Trump Always Wanted a Trade War—and Now He’s Got Several"
